  The honest window is roughly sigma 0.24 to 0.30. Below it the wall
  crossings stop being numerically resolvable; above it a feature reaches
  the diagonal. The window is set by numerical resolution and by peak
  merging, not by anything topological, and the WALL LOCATIONS themselves
  are unaffected throughout, since r_ik = r_jk contains no sigma.
